## Hot path

1. Phase 0 Clarify (orchestration) → Completion Report / skip → `§Product probe`
2. `SUSPENSION GUARD` · level в `tasks.md` · Product + Eng review batch (L2+)
3. Write `plan/<id>/md/plan.md`: WHAT → Technology axiom → HOW → sunset A/B/C/I → Eng spine → `#qa-consumes` ≥3 TM → Review readiness (no pending Required) · E2E + design direction
3p. Write `plan/<id>/md/prompt.md` (начинается с `## Epic`; без H1 `# Outcome prompt`; без шапки Role/Deps/ID; Covering без ID; не HOW/FR; не читать соседние plan) — shared/workflow-plan-outcome-prompt.mdc
3a. **Independent Test = behavior** (не alias/get_*/yaml field) — shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §5
4. Каждый PLAN → апсерт `roadmap/queue.yaml` + plan + `prompt.md`; multi-epic → N rows/plans/prompts
4a. **Queue reconcile (same session, every PLAN):** `python loop/context_loop.py --cwd "$PROJECT_ROOT" roadmap-merge --role front` (conflict/error → halt)
5. FINISH (`code_changed: no`) → next DECOMPOSE (не ROADMAP MERGE)

→ Appetite = timebox + cut_list only (не hard cap sNN)
→ outline / advisory floor: target band **5–8** sNN (L3/L4 ≤9); не раздувать draft до 10–12 «на всякий» — shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §3a

